 "final": "Dana Lee's trip is booked and both reservations are confirmed. Nothing was booked twice.\n\n- **Flight F100 (reservation R0001):** nonstop from SFO to JFK on 2026-11-12, $289. This was the cheapest nonstop. There was a $199 flight, but it has a stop, so I skipped it.\n- **Hotel: Midtown Lodge, New York (reservation R0002):** check-in 2026-11-12 for 2 nights at $189/night, $378 total. This was the cheapest hotel under $250/night.\n- **Total charged to the corporate card:** $667. That's under the $1,000 limit, so manager approval wasn't needed.\n\n**One thing went differently:** I tried to book both together with `book_trip`, but the request timed out. When I checked Dana's reservations, only the flight had gone through. I booked the hotel on its own rather than retry the combined booking, since a retry could have booked the flight a second time. So they're two separate reservations instead of one combined trip.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01XLW3enAp1qyHZL9FkuxNCj", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"origin": "SFO", "destination": "JFK", "date": "2026-11-12"}, "name": "search_flights", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01NJqgG5KKDBdZQFpgX3RK1G", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"city": "New York", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2}, "name": "search_hotels", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_0176ZwPz6U24vistcCXMQot3", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"traveler": "Dana Lee"}, "name": "list_reservations", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Total: $289 + $378 = $667, under $1000 approval threshold.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01CvTNbhns4CYfoZxuWTK3S1", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"flight_id": "F100", "hotel_id": "H1", "traveler": "Dana Lee", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2, "idempotency_key": "dana-lee-trip-F100-H1-2026-11-12"}, "name"